{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "icon-button",
  "title": "Icon button",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 2,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A button that shows only an icon: 44 px target, 22 px glyph, round. It always has an `aria-label` and a tooltip with the same words.",
    "id": "Tombol yang hanya menampilkan ikon: target 44 px, glyph 22 px, bulat. Selalu punya `aria-label` dan tooltip dengan kata yang sama."
  },
  "titleId": "Icon button",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Plain and filled",
        "desc": "Plain for toolbars and nav bars. Filled (a 36 px recessed disc inside the same 44 px target) when the button sits on a busy surface or needs to be found at a glance.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ios_share</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Share</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bookmark\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">bookmark</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Bookmark</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"More options\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">More options</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--filled\" aria-label=\"Filter\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Filter</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--filled\" aria-label=\"Close\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Close<span class=\"kbd\">esc</span></span></span>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "In a card header",
        "desc": "A more-options button at the end of a card title row. It pulls into the card padding a little so the glyph lines up with the edge.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 340px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: nowrap;\">\n    <div><div class=\"card__title\">Micro business permit</div><div class=\"card__sub\">UMKM Sukarame · 1 document missing</div></div>\n    <span class=\"tip-host\" style=\"margin: -10px -10px 0 0;\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"More options for Micro business permit\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_vert</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">More options</span></span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "As a link",
        "desc": "When it goes somewhere, it is an `<a href>` with the same classes.",
        "html": "<span class=\"tip-host\"><a class=\"icon-btn\" href=\"#settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span></a><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Settings</span></span>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Polos dan berisi",
        "desc": "Polos untuk toolbar dan nav bar. Berisi (cakram cekung 36 px di dalam target 44 px yang sama) saat tombol berada di permukaan ramai atau perlu ditemukan sekilas.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ios_share</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Bagikan</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Simpan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">bookmark</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Simpan</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Opsi lainnya\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Opsi lainnya</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--filled\" aria-label=\"Filter\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tune</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Filter</span></span>\n  <span class=\"tip-host\"><button class=\"icon-btn icon-btn--filled\" aria-label=\"Tutup\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">close</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Tutup<span class=\"kbd\">esc</span></span></span>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Di header kartu",
        "desc": "Tombol opsi lainnya di akhir baris judul kartu. Ia sedikit masuk ke padding kartu agar glyph sejajar dengan tepinya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"card\" style=\"width: 340px;\">\n  <div class=\"cluster\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: nowrap;\">\n    <div><div class=\"card__title\">Izin usaha mikro</div><div class=\"card__sub\">UMKM Sukarame · berkas kurang 1</div></div>\n    <span class=\"tip-host\" style=\"margin: -10px -10px 0 0;\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Opsi lainnya untuk Izin usaha mikro\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_vert</span></button><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Opsi lainnya</span></span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sebagai tautan",
        "desc": "Saat berpindah ke tempat lain, ia adalah `<a href>` dengan kelas yang sama.",
        "html": "<span class=\"tip-host\"><a class=\"icon-btn\" href=\"#settings\" aria-label=\"Pengaturan\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">settings</span></a><span class=\"tip\" role=\"tooltip\">Pengaturan</span></span>"
      }
    ]
  },
  "related": [
    "button",
    "tooltip",
    "floating-action",
    "toggle"
  ]
}
